src-tauri/**/user-data/

# LanceDB runtime data (RAG vector store)
*.lance
**/.lancedb/

# Dev/prod isolation leftovers — explicit entries for the pre-identifier-split
# era. Already covered by `*.db` and `**/.lancedb/` above, but listed here so
# future agents understand the intent: dev DB names are suffixed `-dev` and
# live under `lancedb-dev/`. Stale files from old installs should never enter
# the repo. Identifier-based isolation (com.zen.app vs com.zen.app.dev) means
# these names are no longer produced at runtime; they only exist as historical
# artifacts on developer machines.
*.dev.db
**/lancedb-dev/

